{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":88804,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793646963903,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":88804,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/88804","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T19:16:03.902Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"If It's for My Daughter, I'd Even Defeat a Demon Lord","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"うちの娘の為ならば、俺はもしかしたら魔王も倒せるかもしれない。","overview":{"value":"Dale è un esperto e calmo avventuriero che si è già fatto un nome nonostante la giovane età. Un giorno, mentre è al lavoro nel profondo di una foresta, trova una piccola bambina demone abbandonata; non riuscendo a lasciarla lì a morire, il giovane la porta a casa sua e ne diviene il padre adottivo. Demone o no, Latina (il nome che le ha dato) è una bambina adorabile e Dale le vuole un mondo di bene. Ma perché la piccola si trovava in quella foresta ? E perché addosso ha il segno di un criminale?","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2019-07-04","endDate":"2019-09-19","status":"Ended","rating":7.3,"ratingCount":56,"numberOfEpisodes":12,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"24m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":861,"name":"BS11","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/JQ5bx6n7Qmdmyqz6sqjo5Fz2iR.png"},{"id":2478,"name":"Tochigi TV","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2v82HpzoKRveJEJcGHkeTcktMRM.png"},{"id":614,"name":"TOKYO MX","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSdroyVthq3CynxTIIY7lnS8w1.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1245094,"name":"Nobuhiko Okamoto","role":"Dale Leki (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7s1K2yQVF5iIWILaOfG7QrMZkXA.jpg"},{"id":1695709,"name":"Kanon Takao","role":"Latina (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3h6h9R29uRsOv01qbk94ym2msm.jpg"},{"id":2312002,"name":"Katsumi Fukuhara","role":"Anthony (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ijpwBGoo3iPmb9v1Oh4Fz9CFzOx.jpg"},{"id":1763402,"name":"Yuuki Kuwahara","role":"Chloe (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n9kLcB2YNl9S2kK6b2rId7cpjdh.jpg"},{"id":1251325,"name":"Tsuyoshi Koyama","role":"Kenis (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xm7AT3bF4ARZvbx87ixXT8rNFgs.jpg"},{"id":1838364,"name":"Yuuki Hirose","role":"Marcel (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nLkHDUioXgQtQ74thpY2PfzFx6V.jpg"},{"id":1255653,"name":"Manami Numakura","role":"Rita (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDbMXgeTCA2D6i7894Ag43RADrk.jpg"},{"id":1253972,"name":"Mutsumi Tamura","role":"Rudy (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg"},{"id":1951289,"name":"Marika Kouno","role":"Silvia (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGtrlF6iBDHoBEmRfPdOyVt7X18.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"If It's for My Daughter, I'd Even Defeat a Demon Lord","overview":"Dale è un esperto e calmo avventuriero che si è già fatto un nome nonostante la giovane età. Un giorno, mentre è al lavoro nel profondo di una foresta, trova una piccola bambina demone abbandonata; non riuscendo a lasciarla lì a morire, il giovane la porta a casa sua e ne diviene il padre adottivo. Demone o no, Latina (il nome che le ha dato) è una bambina adorabile e Dale le vuole un mondo di bene. Ma perché la piccola si trovava in quella foresta ? E perché addosso ha il segno di un criminale?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"If It's for My Daughter, I'd Even Defeat a Demon Lord","overview":"Dale is a cool, composed, and highly skilled adventurer who's made quite a name for himself despite his youth. One day on a job deep in the forest, he comes across a little devil girl who's almost wasted away. Unable to just leave her there to die, Dale takes her home and becomes her adoptive father.\n\nDevil or not, Latina is beyond adorable, and the adventurer soon finds himself head over heels with being a parent. But why was she out in the forest to begin with, and why does she carry the mark of a criminal?"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"うちの娘の為ならば、俺はもしかしたら魔王も倒せるかもしれない。","overview":"若くして頭角を現し、近隣にその名を知られる凄腕冒険者の青年「デイル」。とある依頼で深い森へと足を踏み入れた彼は、ガリガリにやせ細った幼い魔人族の少女「ラティナ」と出逢う。罪人の烙印を押されたラティナをそのまま放置できず、保護者になることを決意したデイルだったが――「ラティナが可愛すぎて、仕事に行きたくない」 ――気づけばすっかり親バカ全開に!?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aSSTFy2JGkn1n3fhWsDUISwWCov.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aSSTFy2JGkn1n3fhWsDUISwWCov.png","language":"en","width":540,"height":296},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wZDehCVhR1Dy4lai2SVAXG7kJ7Z.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wZDehCVhR1Dy4lai2SVAXG7kJ7Z.png","language":"en","width":349,"height":297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNbdlQm8AGLzBJNq8oVk71aMUai.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zNbdlQm8AGLzBJNq8oVk71aMUai.png","language":"en","width":545,"height":298}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jv37TjutT1zXSWLmDgTF9BbBOcp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jv37TjutT1zXSWLmDgTF9BbBOcp.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1800},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/slD6yWlW0qYC1diJoxCaNKPxndg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/slD6yWlW0qYC1diJoxCaNKPxndg.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgtQB9l314wgcinNCQgV2x8elpw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zgtQB9l314wgcinNCQgV2x8elpw.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vtpPJuEhoAdDuaHbOIFRfvWWJ3n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vtpPJuEhoAdDuaHbOIFRfvWWJ3n.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://imag